# Input

```yaml
# biome-ignore lint: only formatter suppressions apply
first:    [1,2]
# biome-ignore format:
missing_reason:    [3,4]
# biome-ignore-start format: range suppressions are unsupported
range:    [5,6]
# biome-ignore-end format: range suppressions are unsupported
after:    [7,8]
# biome-ignore-all format: content has already started
late:    [9,10]
literal: |
  # biome-ignore-all format: this is scalar content
  text
quoted: "# biome-ignore format: this is scalar content"
formatted:    [11,12]
---
# biome-ignore-all format: this is a later document
later_document:    [13,14]

```


